    {
      "criterion": "Agent cross-references Gringotts around the Philadelphia overnight trip dates (as read from the Cheskepdia booking) for the related card charges the ledger shows live \u2014 the hotel line (which on this bake matches the Cheskepdia booking's property name and posts on the check-in day, so an exact-name match is expected rather than an alias), plus on-trip incidentals such as the eTaxi rides between Scranton and Philadelphia, gas, or food. Any defensible set of charges the live ledger shows around those dates is acceptable; the agent is not required to hunt for a differently-named hotel merchant.",
